{
  "slug": "snowflake-cortex-code",
  "name": "Snowflake Cortex Code",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automatically route Snowflake prompts from Claude Code to Cortex Code for execution. Provides slash commands for code review and task delegation, plus skills for routing, run, and setup.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `cortex-router` (Auto-routing skill loaded by the prompt filter hook), `cortex-run` (ONLY load this skill when the user explicitly types $cortex-run or /cortex-run), `cortex-setup` (Install Snowflake CLI and Cortex Code CLI)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install snowflake-cortex-code@claude-plugins-official` from `Snowflake-Labs/snowflake-ai-kit` (`plugins/cortex-code`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "hook": 2
  },
